libinjection
------------------------------------------
SQL / SQLI tokenizer parser analyzer

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libinjection-devel-4.0.2-1bl1
  libinjection4-4.0.2-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libinjection/libinjection

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libinjection/libinjection/archive/refs/tags/v4.0.2.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libinjection-4.0.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libinjection-4.0.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libinjection-4.0.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libinjection-4.0.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libinjection4-4.0.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libinjection-devel-4.0.2-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libinjection)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libinjection.README
  /usr/share/doc/libinjection/CHANGELOG.md
  /usr/share/doc/libinjection/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libinjection/README.md

(libinjection4)
  /usr/bin/cyginjection-4.dll

(libinjection-devel)
  /usr/include/libinjection.h
  /usr/include/libinjection_error.h
  /usr/include/libinjection_html5.h
  /usr/include/libinjection_sqli.h
  /usr/include/libinjection_sqli_data.h
  /usr/include/libinjection_xss.h
  /usr/lib/libinjection.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libinjection.pc

